    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MURPHY MULLAN are delighted to present this wonderful opportunity to acquire this fantastic ground floor, own door, two-bedroom apartment in excellent condition throughout for sale. \r\n\r\nNo 59 comes to the market with beautiful interior. The property has a number of bonus features including its excellent location, high spec bathroom, private own door access and south facing outside terrace making this one for the shortlist!\r\n\r\n\r\nIn terms of location is enviably positioned within arm’s reach of all essential amenities including esteemed primary & secondary schools, extensive leisure & sports facilities, convenience stores & Shopping Centres. On a transport note, bus routes are plentiful and The Luas & M50 Motorway are found within minutes by car.\r\n\r\nBright and spacious accommodation includes: Entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, main bathroom, two double bedrooms, one with ensuite. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside the property is further complimented by a south facing garden terrace. \r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: Wooden Flooring\r\nLiving Room:\tWooden Flooring\r\nKitchen: Tiled flooring and part wall tiling an array of wooden presses top and bottom. \r\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Sliding door to patio area and communal garden.\r\nBedroom 2: Master bedroom. Wooden flooring / fitted wardrobes.\r\nEn suite: Floor tiling. Shower cubicle with electric triton shower, WC and WHB.\r\nMain Bathroom: Fully tiled bathroom. Chrome heated towel rail. Jacuzzi bath tub, WC and WHB. \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nFront: Communal Parking  \r\nRear Garden:  South Facing garden terrace."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent mature residential location!\r\nBeautiful Decor\r\nGFCH\r\nDouble glazed windows & doors\r\nSolid wood flooring\r\nPrivate own door access\r\nSouth Facing outdoor terrace\r\nA host of schools and amenities nearby\r\n77sq meters"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1"
      }
